    {"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"handled — выбран handler; ignored — update не подошёл ни одному handler; failed — ошибка handler. Цвет отражает смысл результата, а не размер значения.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"fixedColor":"blue","mode":"fixed"},"decimals":0,"min":0,"unit":"short"},"overrides":[{"matcher":{"id":"byRegexp","options":".*failed.*"},"properties":[{"id":"color","value":{"fixedColor":"red","mode":"fixed"}}]}]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":6,"x":0,"y":13},"id":10,"options":{"displayMode":"basic","orientation":"horizontal","reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"],"fields":"","values":false}},"targets":[{"expr":"round(sum(increase(srm_event_outcomes_total[$__range])) by (chat_type, outcome))","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{chat_type}} / {{outcome}}","range":false,"refId":"A"}],"title":"Telegram updates за период","type":"bargauge"},
    {"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Webhook и top-10 handler p95 за выбранный период. Handlers показаны минимум с 5 вызовами, чтобы не выдавать единичное наблюдение за устойчивый перцентиль.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"fixedColor":"orange","mode":"fixed"},"decimals":2,"min":0,"noValue":"Недостаточно данных","unit":"s"},"overrides":[{"matcher":{"id":"byName","options":"Webhook"},"properties":[{"id":"color","value":{"fixedColor":"blue","mode":"fixed"}}]}]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":12,"x":6,"y":13},"id":11,"options":{"displayMode":"basic","orientation":"horizontal","reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"],"fields":"","values":false}},"targets":[{"expr":"topk(10, histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(increase(srm_handler_duration_seconds_bucket[$__range])) by (le, handler)) and on (handler) sum(increase(srm_handler_duration_seconds_count[$__range])) by (handler) >= 5)","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{handler}}","range":false,"refId":"A"},{"expr":"histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(increase(srm_request_duration_seconds_bucket[$__range])) by (le))","instant":true,"legendFormat":"Webhook","range":false,"refId":"B"}],"title":"Задержка p95 за период","type":"bargauge"},
    {"datasource":{"type":"prometheus","uid":"prometheus"},"description":"Число вызовов каждого handler строго дольше выбранного histogram-порога за период.","fieldConfig":{"defaults":{"color":{"fixedColor":"red","mode":"fixed"},"decimals":0,"min":0,"unit":"short"},"overrides":[]},"gridPos":{"h":8,"w":6,"x":18,"y":13},"id":12,"options":{"displayMode":"basic","orientation":"horizontal","reduceOptions":{"calcs":["lastNotNull"],"fields":"","values":false}},"targets":[{"expr":"round(sum(increase(srm_handler_duration_seconds_count[$__range])) by (handler) - sum(increase(srm_handler_duration_seconds_bucket{le=\"$slow_threshold\"}[$__range])) by (handler)) > 0","instant":true,"legendFormat":"{{handler}}","range":false,"refId":"A"}],"title":"Вызовы дольше $slow_threshold с","type":"bargauge"},

